          "+                        GitHub announced major Copilot updates at Microsoft Build 2026 including agent-native desktop experience, CLI improvements with voice input and rubber duck feature, and new proprietary AI models. On June 1, 2026, GitHub began using Copilot interactions to train their AI models.",
