          "                     <div class=\"item-title\">",
          "-                        <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/blog/changelist-feb25\">Windsurf: Wave 3 Updates and Enhanced Features</a>",
          "+                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/5/openai-help-lockdown-mode/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">",
          "+                            OpenAI Launches Lockdown Mode to Prevent Data Exfiltration",
          "+                        </a>",
          "                     </div>",
          "                     <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        Windsurf released Wave 3 updates including better credit tracking, revamped Turbo Mode, and customizable app icons for Mac users.",
          "+                        OpenAI released Lockdown Mode to help prevent the final stage of data exfiltration from prompt injection attacks by limiting outbound network requests. This directly addresses the 'Lethal Trifecta' (private data access + untrusted content exposure + data exfiltration vectors) by cutting off the exfiltration leg. Simon Willison notes this implies ChatGPT's default settings don't provide robust protection against determined data exfiltration attacks.",
          "                     </div>",
