          "-                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/4/ai-enthusiists-skeptics/\" class=\"insight-link\">AI Enthusiasts vs. Skeptics: Race Against Time vs. Entropy</a>",
          "+                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/4/ai-enthusiists-skeptics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">",
          "+                            AI Enthusiasts vs. Skeptics: Race Against Time vs. Entropy",
          "+                        </a>",
          "                     </div>",
          "                     <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        Charity Majors captures the dynamic between AI enthusiasts and skeptics: enthusiasts race against time while skeptics race against entropy.",
          "+                        Charity Majors captures the dynamic between AI enthusiasts and skeptics: enthusiasts race against time as teams that don't adopt AI could face existential threats from competitors, while skeptics race against entropy as shipping code faster than engineers can read degrades reliability and institutional knowledge. The key issue is there's no natural feedback loop connecting the two groups.",
          "                     </div>",
